        "text": "The outside-view base rate uses the eight consecutive preliminary prints from 2024-Q3 through 2026-Q2. Their sum is 16.7 and their mean is 2.0875%. Before current-quarter adjustments, an equally weighted reference-class and latest-print persistence prior is (2.0875 + 1.3)/2 = 1.69375%."
