        "kind": "text",
        "text": "The current-quarter bridge uses supplementary proxies: GDP rather than exact nonfarm business output, and private payroll earnings rather than total hourly compensation. Monthly observations combine available publication vintages. Benefits, bonuses, proprietors' compensation, and sector composition can therefore move the target away from this bridge. BEA's fetched September annual update also revises compensation inputs. GDPNow is an institution-published model estimate, rather than an official GDP print."
