        "text": "Quarterly earnings means are 37.5000 and 37.736667, giving wage growth = 100*((37.736667/37.5000)^4 - 1) = 2.548443%. Hours means are 116.666667 and 117.033333, giving hours growth = 1.263082%. Treating GDPNow as an output proxy gives productivity growth = 100*(1.037/1.01263082 - 1) = 2.406522%. The ULC bridge is 100*(1.02548443/1.02406522 - 1) = 0.138586%. Equal weighting of this bridge and the 1.69375% prior gives 0.916168%, rounded to a 0.9% forecast."
